# "trance lead" (lead track): a short anthem line with a pitch bend; the voice must be freed after the release.
tempo 138
steps 16
tail 3.0
track lead
preset 128 170 0 90 200 50 0 0 128 0 128 190 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 A4 3 127
note 3 C5 1 110
note 4 E5 4 127
note 8 D5 2 100
note 10 C5 2 100
bend 10 100
note 12 A4 4 127
bend 14 0
expect sound 0 16
expect idle 40
expect peak_below -4      # one voice peaks around -8 dBFS; a releasing note overlaps the next
